{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"带着对那种不必防备的生活的牵挂往前，他反倒觉得它近了些，舍不得它也让他愿意担起眼前的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"近了些\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"从前一想到那种生活，他就想退回安宁，仿佛不争取便能保住它。如今他愿为它离开安宁去做事。\",\n      \"key\": \"离开安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再拼命也未必换得回那种生活，若只凭舍不得一味硬撑，反会耗掉他想护住的温柔。\",\n      \"key\": \"一味硬撑\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"担起眼前的事时，他仍肯承认自己舍不得那种亲近，不再把这份依恋当成软弱。\",\n      \"key\": \"当成软弱\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他又尝到最初相信生活时的高兴。走过怀疑和疲惫，他更珍惜它，不拿它当作事情会好的保证。\",\n      \"key\": \"更珍惜它\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"那种生活还没回来，努力能改变多少仍说不准。愿望未成，他也不把过去的安宁说成假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"过去的安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，代价真摆到眼前时，也可能又想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"text\": \"兴奋退下去，他终于能松口气。心里仍有疑问，他却不再等每个疑问都有答案才肯向前。\",\n      \"key\": \"才肯向前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R70\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿在行动中反而变近，以及这份舍不得开始推动他承担眼前的事；不把两种心意的共同作用写成冲突已经彻底消失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留过去想退回安宁、如今愿为那种生活离开安宁行动的转折；删去前段已交代的现实障碍，避免重复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\", \"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把如何坚持落到具体代价：拼命不保证愿望实现，一味硬撑还可能耗掉想护住的温柔。保留愿意付出与不能耗尽所爱之间的取舍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再因依恋羞愧、也不因承担责任而厌弃自己所珍惜的生活，改为担事时仍肯承认舍不得，不再把依恋当成软弱。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留怀疑和疲惫之后快乐重新回来、因而更值得珍惜的事实；不替他宣布抽象领悟，也不把快乐写成事情必会好转的保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R75\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留现实尚未改变、努力结果未明，以及愿望未成不等于过去的安宁是假的。眼前的高兴不能代替尚未实现的生活，未实现的愿望也不能抹掉真实得到过的安宁。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把未来可能疲惫、因代价想退回去落到过去硬撑到疲惫和仍心疼付出的经历上，不再用抽象的冲突免责声明收尾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-8\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再反复为向前寻找证明，改成心里仍有疑问也不再等所有问题都解决才肯走；避免重复前段关于努力是否有效的判断，并为结尾的安静与明确留下心理依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "214f8db4-dfc5-445e-a087-68666e3bcd97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T121409438012Z", "elapsed_seconds": 981.61, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T12:30:31.067721+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2fb366b935e0e8a62376c05fe563eb19a67c9c571a4cf41b2c0b962172021707", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T121409438012Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "d57a020406b3ea555b1ff7746b9a34ae73e838041e820c9668ead200fc9c4801"}}}
